  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Economic Planning and Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) in Nigeria.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen the institutional and human resource capacities of the Ministry of Budget and Economic Planning (MBEP), the National Bureau of Statistics (NBS), and the Office of the Senior Special Assistant to the President on SDGs (OSSAP-SDGs). It will enhance their ability to design, implement, and monitor development strategies that align with Nigeria&#x2019;s national priorities and the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), with a focus on inclusive growth and poverty reduction.</narrative>
  </description>
